{"title":"1980 AHSME Problems/Problem 3","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If the ratio of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/a/84ae1552b5cf6f0ff4835ec599cb284cded1af54.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2x-y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"53\" height=\"17\" /> to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/3/d/d3da9f8c7fe0473fdd6f8597eff61d71fedda430.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x+y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"44\" height=\"16\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/5/4/7547747b133453d3c209cff6cfbf129aa67a6947.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{2}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"15\" height=\"38\" />, what is the ratio of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/6/e/c6e3a46b579a4278093c77c44e2e4e71abbcf813.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)} \\ \\frac{1}{5} \\qquad \\text{(B)} \\ \\frac{4}{5} \\qquad \\text{(C)} \\ 1 \\qquad \\text{(D)} \\ \\frac{6}{5} \\qquad \\text{(E)} \\ \\frac{5}{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"345\" height=\"38\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/0/1/f01e39d8ae76588d68c2f471dc903fefbfeadfa4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{2x-y}{x+y} = \\frac{2}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"94\" height=\"42\" />\n</p><p>Cross multiplying yields  \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/f/f/3ff8d8099743ee171dda7ec5a58ac51eb05c07d0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6x-3y=2x+2y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"147\" height=\"17\" /> \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/a/2/0a2673439280a3687a0f7b484d07dc9e24fd02b3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4x=5y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"61\" height=\"16\" /> \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/0/f/40f4a85a6c85e489cd7ea84b04e5280a008b3188.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\dfrac{x}{y}= \\boxed{(\\textbf{E}) \\dfrac{5}{4}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -19px\" width=\"92\" height=\"49\" /> \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME\" title=\"1980 AHSME\">1980 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1980 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1980 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1980\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1980 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1980 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">Problem 4</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1980 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1980 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1980 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1980 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1980 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1980 AHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1980 AHSME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1980 AHSME Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1980 AHSME Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1980 AHSME Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"1980 AHSME Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"1980 AHSME Problems/Problem 13\">13</a